[[File:20170414Galium odoratum2.jpg|thumb|'''sweet woodruff''', ''[[Galium odoratum]]'']]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# An aromatic [[perennial]] [[plant]], formerly used as a [[strewing herb]], ''[[Galium odoratum]]'' (formerly ''[[Asperula odorata]]''), with small white flowers.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|herb}} {{vern|sweetscented bedstraw}}, {{l|en|waldmeister}}, {{l|en|woodruff}}, {{l|en|wuderove}}

